OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Frain or showers this evening. Drier
OL,7,Fand clearer spells developing
OL,8,Fovernight, but still some showers,
OL,9,Fthese most frequent in the west.
OL,10,FStrengthening west to southwest winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FSunny intervals and showers,
OL,13,Fthe showers quite heavy but passing
OL,14,Fthrough quickly. Fresh to strong
OL,15,Fwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
