OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,6,Fwith isolated showers on Saturday
OL,7,Fmorning, cloudier later with some
OL,8,Frain. Windy with some showers on
OL,9,FSunday. Bright start Monday then
OL,10,Fshowers, some heavy.
